      "alt": "Token Gremlin •\n@TokenGremlin • 11h X\nGood morning, my friends. Unfortunately, I've got some bad news about OpenAl.\nI know a lot of you were disappointed yesterday when GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol didn't launch.\nI've heard that the reason behind the delay was that some serious alignment and safety issues were discovered at the last minute and needed to be fixed.\nA few more days of polishing and fixing those issues, and we should finally see the models launch. So we need to be patient. The team is working hard.\nAs for performance, pricing, and speed, don't worry. Based on early access testing, we're getting something incredible.",
