      "alt": "Rollofthedice @hotrollhottakes.bsky.social He/They\n\nspeaking of - what do you think the Times is getting out of this, and your opinion of them/their upper leadership or management?\n\nThey get two things at once. Treating MAGA grievance like sacred folk anthropology buys cover against right-wing bias complaints without having to call false claims false, and it farms massive rage-engagement from the liberal subscribers paying for Cooking and Games.\n\nAs for Sulzberger and Joe Kahn, I think they're smug dynastic cowards. Sulzberger wrote a piece celebrating five generations of family stewardship and calling Kahn \"steel-spined,\" when all that spine goes into punching down on trans healthcare and begging the right to see how neutral they are.",
